            <strong>Master of Science in Social Data Science</strong> (with distinction)<br>
            <span class="faded">Oxford Internet Institute, University of Oxford. 2022–2023.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Post-baccalaureate certification</strong> (with honors)<br>
