          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Masters of Arts in Communication and Culture</strong><br>
            <span class="faded">Federal University of Rio de Janeiro. 2016.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Bachelor in Social Communication (Journalism)</strong><br>
            <span class="faded">Federal University of Rio de Janeiro. 2010.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Philosophy</strong> (unfinished)<br>
            <span class="faded">State University of Rio de Janeiro. 2005–2008.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="section-label reveal">File Section: Courses</div>
