      <div class="section-label reveal">File Section: Teaching Experience</div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>
          As head of the School of Data Brazil, Adriano created, coordinated, and taught several online and in-person trainings
          between 2019 and 2022, such as
          <a href="https://escoladedados.org/dados-360-comunicacao-baseada-em-dados/">Dados 360</a>,
          <a href="https://escoladedados.org/courses/jornalismo-de-dados-ambientais/">Jornalismo de dados ambientais</a>, and
          <a href="https://escoladedados.org/courses/investigacoes-digitais/">Investigações digitais</a>.
        </p>
        <ul class="cv-list">
          <li><strong>Brasiliense Institute of Public Law</strong> — Lecturer in data journalism MBA program <span class="stamp">2021–2022</span></li>
          <li><strong>Higher Education Institute of Brasilia</strong> — Lecturer of data journalism <span class="stamp">2019</span></li>
          <li><strong>University of Texas / Knight Center</strong> — Teaching assistant <span class="stamp">2019</span></li>
        </ul>
